<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Q4 GDP rises 1.1 pct from Q3.</title>
<headline>Swedish Q4 GDP rises 1.1 pct from Q3.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Gross Domestic Product rose 1.1 percent in the fourth quarter of 1996 versus the third quarter and by 1.8 percent compared with the fourth quarter of 1995, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>(In full-year 1996 GDP rose by 1.1 percent.)</p>
<p> SWEDISH GDP	     Q4	Q3	Full Year</p>
<p> 1996		   +  1.8  +  0.4	+ 1.1</p>
<p> 1995		   +  2.9  +  5.0	+ 3.6</p>
<p>Note - A Reuter survey of market forecasts gave an average expectation of a 0.9 percent rise on a quarter-on-quarter basis. -- Stockholm newsroom +46 8 7001017</p>
</text>
